Dedicated enforcing logging domains for persistent logcat and a read-only hardware snapshot.
Keep permissions scoped to these collectors; neither needs access to raw input events.
The FAT context mount needs init relabelfrom/relabelto on the dedicated filesystem label.
Drop with the persistent diagnostic logger.

--- a/system/etc/selinux/plat_sepolicy.cil
